    <ThingDef ParentName="CVN_BP_AutogunBase">
        <defName>CVN_BP_Gun_HeavyStubber</defName>
        <label>Pact heavy stubber</label>
        <description>Heavy stubbers are large autoguns usually employed on economically poor worlds that cannot maintain energy based armaments. While inferior to higher-tech weapons of the same weight, it can still provide reliable firepower. \n\nThis is likely one of the few weapons fully manufactured by the Pact, instead of the Forgeworld of Urdesh.</description>
        <graphicData>
	        <drawSize>1.3</drawSize>
            <texPath>Things/Item/Equipment/WeaponRanged/BP_Heavystubber</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
